#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/sphinx.rst:-1
msgid "Hosting Sphinx documentation on Read the Docs."
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 上托管 Sphinx 文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/sphinx.rst:3
msgid "Deploying Sphinx on Read the Docs"
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 上部署 Sphinx"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/sphinx.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Sphinx`_ is a powerful documentation generator that has many features for "
"writing technical documentation. Sphinx is written in Python, and supports "
"documentation written in reStructuredText and Markdown."
msgstr ""
"`Sphinx`_ 是一个强大的文档生成器，具有许多编写技术文档的功能。Sphinx 使用 Python 编写，支持用 reStructuredText"
" 和 Markdown 编写文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/sphinx.rst:12
msgid ""
"Minimal configuration required to build an existing Sphinx project on Read "
"the Docs looks like this, specifying a Python 3.x toolchain on Ubuntu, using"
" the built-in :ref:`sphinx <config-file/v2:sphinx>` command, and defining "
"the location of the installation requirements:"
msgstr ""
"在 Read the Docs 上构建现有 Sphinx 项目所需的最小配置如下所示，它在 Ubuntu 上指定 Python 3.x "
"工具链，使用内置的 :ref:`sphinx <config-file/v2:sphinx>` 命令，并定义安装依赖的位置："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/sphinx.rst:16
msgid ".readthedocs.yaml"
msgstr ".readthedocs.yaml"

