msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/sphinx.rst:38
msgid ""
"If you have an existing Sphinx project you want to host on Read the Docs, "
"check out our :doc:`/intro/add-project` guide."
msgstr "如果你已有想在 Read the Docs 上托管的 Sphinx 项目，请参阅 :doc:`/intro/add-project` 指南。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/sphinx.rst:39
msgid ""
"If you're new to Sphinx, check out the official `Getting started with "
"Sphinx`_ guide."
msgstr "如果你还不熟悉 Sphinx，请参阅官方的 `Getting started with Sphinx`_ 指南。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/sphinx.rst:40
msgid ""
"For a step-by-step tutorial on Read the Docs using an example Sphinx "
