msgstr "将 Read the Docs 版本菜单集成到站点导航中"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/sphinx.rst:102
msgid ""
"The :ref:`flyout-menu:Addons flyout menu` displays differently depending on "
"which Sphinx theme your documentation uses."
msgstr ":ref:`flyout-menu:Addons flyout menu` 的显示方式取决于你的文档所使用的 Sphinx 主题。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/sphinx.rst:104
msgid ""
"If you're using the `Read the Docs Sphinx Theme <https://sphinx-rtd-"
"theme.readthedocs.io/en/stable/>`__, the :ref:`flyout-menu:Addons flyout "
"menu` is already fully integrated into the theme. Use the theme options "
"`flyout_display <https://sphinx-rtd-"
"theme.readthedocs.io/en/stable/configuring.html#confval-flyout_display>`__, "
"`version_selector <https://sphinx-rtd-"
"theme.readthedocs.io/en/stable/configuring.html#confval-"
"version_selector>`__, `language_selector <https://sphinx-rtd-"
"theme.readthedocs.io/en/stable/configuring.html#confval-"
"language_selector>`__ to configure it."
msgstr ""
"如果你使用的是 `Read the Docs Sphinx Theme <https://sphinx-rtd-"
"theme.readthedocs.io/en/stable/>`__ ，:ref:`flyout-menu:Addons flyout menu` "
"已经完整集成到该主题中。可使用主题选项 `flyout_display <https://sphinx-rtd-"
"theme.readthedocs.io/en/stable/configuring.html#confval-flyout_display>`__ "
"、`version_selector <https://sphinx-rtd-"
"theme.readthedocs.io/en/stable/configuring.html#confval-version_selector>`__"
" 、`language_selector <https://sphinx-rtd-"
"theme.readthedocs.io/en/stable/configuring.html#confval-"
"language_selector>`__ 进行配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/sphinx.rst:106
msgid ""
"If you're using another theme, the flyout menu displays in the bottom right "
"of the docs."
msgstr "如果你使用其他主题，浮出菜单会显示在文档右下角。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/sphinx.rst:108
msgid ""
"In either case, you can configure the flyout menu sorting and display "
"options in your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Flyout "
"menu`."
msgstr ""
"无论哪种情况，你都可以在项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Addons --> Flyout menu` "
"中配置浮出菜单的排序和显示选项。"

